  m_Name: Kat_7
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KatZinciriVarligi
  aciklama: "7. kat, daire 1, Cemal'in dairesi (g\xF6zlem). Sahanl\u0131kta d\xF6rt
    '13' kap\u0131s\u0131, ger\xE7e\u011Fi farklar\u0131yla bulunur; yanl\u0131\u015F
    kap\u0131 bir olay tetikler. Elektriksiz daire, alt\u0131 kilit: banyo kilitsiz
    (n\xFCfus c\xFCzdan\u0131), salon (1107; b\xFCfede kiler anahtar\u0131), kiler
    (mutfak anahtar\u0131), mutfak (anahtar\u0131n ucu; ba\u015F\u0131 holdeki konsolda),
    Oda A (k\u0131r\u0131k anahtar; foto\u011Fraf\u0131n arkas\u0131nda 0913), Oda
    B (0913), sand\u0131k (tornavidayla kan\u0131rt) -> kat\u0131n anahtar\u0131,
    ka\xE7\u0131\u015F. Oda oda d\xF6\u015Fendi (#83), #114 seyreltildi."
